message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EarEEG-Frontal-Decoder-Repro"
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Amini
    given-names: Ali
repository-code: "https://github.com/AliAmini93/EarEEG-Frontal-Decoder-Repro"
abstract: >-
  Python software for experimental methods of Frontal Electrode Contributions and
  Blink-Like Transients in Ear-Centered EEG Decoding, a manuscript in preparation.
  Includes montage comparisons, frontal transient controls, shrinkage LDA, EEGNet,
  xDAWN-TS-LR, EEG-Inception ERP, paired training-condition comparisons and a
  source-only nested sensitivity.
keywords:
  - ear-eeg
  - research-software
  - reproducible-research
  - python
